      "writtenOn": "2016-12-16T23:21:34Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is missing the \"\u003e\" so it\u0027 won\u0027t render correctly. How about...\n\n---\nfeatures:\n  - \u003e\n    [`blueprint pci-dss-query-password-expired-users \u003chttps://blueprints.launchpad.net/keystone/+spec/pci-dss-query-password-expired-users\u003e`_]\n    Added a ``password_expires_at`` query to ``/v3/users`` and ``/v3/groups/{group_id}/users``. The ``password_expires_at`` query is comprised of two parts, an ``operator`` (valid choices listed below) and a ``timestamp`` (of form ``YYYY-MM-DDTHH:mm:ssZ``). The APIs will filter the list of users based on the ``operator`` and ``timestamp`` given. \n\n      * lt - password expires before the timestamp\n      * lte - password expires at or before timestamp\n      * gt - password expires after the timestamp\n      * gte - password expires at or after the timestamp\n      * eq - password expires at the timestamp\n      * neq - password expires not at the timestamp\n\nSee http://developer.openstack.org/api-ref/identity/v3/index.html for more details.",
